OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud and some lengthy
OL,9,Fclear periods. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FMostly dry with some hazy
OL,12,Fsunny spells. Cloudier in the middle
OL,13,Fof the day with the odd light shower.
OL,14,FRain spreads northwest in evening.
OL,15,FBreezy along the east coast later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
