OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FBecoming unsettled with showers or
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain moving north
OL,8,Facross all parts at times, but also
OL,9,Fsome bright warm spells developing.
OL,10,FChance of fresher winds at times.
